          <td data-label="Why">People focus</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Do you like learning tools deeply?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="If yes, lean toward">Technology</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Tool focus</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Question"><strong>Do you like explaining and persuading?</strong></td>
          <td data-label="If yes, lean toward">Management</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Communication focus</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
